000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTMIST.
000400 AUTHOR.         C.I.HILLES.
000500*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
000600*DATE-WRITTEN.   7/27/89.
000700*REMARKS.        REPORT OF ALL CORPORATE CODES, IN STOREROOM CLASS
000800*                GROUPS: WITH SUMMARY PAGE OF AVERAGE DAILY USAGE
000900*                VALUE.  TO BE USED FOR CORPORATE REPORTING FOR
001000*                REDUCING INVENTORIES.
      ****************************************************************
      * CHANGES:                                                     *
      *                                                              *
      *C* 07/11/96   CA YODER                                        *
      *C*   MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.                   *
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *                                                              *
      ****************************************************************
