           IF REPORTING-MONTH-X NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE REPORTING-MONTH-X TO RS-SHIFT-FLD
               CALL "TRSHIFT" USING RS-RET-CODE, RS-SHIFT-FLD
               MOVE RS-SHIFT-FLD-7-8 TO REPORTING-MONTH-X.
           IF NUM-DAYS-WHOLE NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE NUM-DAYS-WHOLE TO RS-SHIFT-FLD
               CALL "TRSHIFT" USING RS-RET-CODE, RS-SHIFT-FLD
               MOVE RS-SHIFT-FLD-7-8 TO NUM-DAYS-WHOLE.
           IF NUM-DAYS-DEC-1 NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "0" TO NUM-DAYS-DEC-1.
           IF NUM-DAYS-DEC-2 NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE "0" TO NUM-DAYS-DEC-2.
           IF NUM-LINES-DESC-X NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE NUM-LINES-DESC-X TO RS-SHIFT-FLD
               CALL "TRSHIFT" USING RS-RET-CODE, RS-SHIFT-FLD
               MOVE RS-SHIFT-FLD-7-8 TO NUM-LINES-DESC-X.
