111300
111400*------ RAW MATERIALS ARE NOT REPORTED ON THIS REPORT.  WE DESIGNATE
111500*------ THOSE WITH A TYPE OF "R" IN THE CLASS ENTRY.
111600*------ ANY CLASS NOT ENTERED GOES INTO GROUP OF "OTHER" (97)
111700     MOVE STR-CLASS                TO   CLASS-KEY-CLASS.
           MOVE CLASS-KEY TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
112000     IF GOOD-CALL
