112900             IF MPLT-MAT-TYPE = "R"
113000                 GO TO 6000-INPUT-RECORDS
113100             ELSE
113200                 MOVE MPLT-GROUP-NUMBER TO SORT-GROUP
113300                 MOVE MPLT-CLASS-DESC TO GROUP-DESC (SORT-GROUP)
113400                 MOVE MPLT-VALUE TO GROUP-CAP-VAL-X (SORT-GROUP)
113500         ELSE
