118300     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
118400         MOVE ZERO                 TO   SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER
118500         MOVE SPACES               TO   BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1.
118600     MOVE SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER   TO   SORT-ONORDER.
118700     IF STR-STOCK-OT = "X"
118800         MOVE "X"                  TO   SORT-OBSOLETE
118900     ELSE
119000     IF STR-INS-ITM = "X" OR "B" OR "1"
