119200     ELSE
      *-------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
119300     IF STR-LAST-IDATE-CN = SPACES
119400         IF STR-INIT-DATE-CN < SLOW-MOVE-DATE-CN
119500             MOVE "X"              TO   SORT-SLOW-MOVE
119600         ELSE
119700             NEXT SENTENCE
119800     ELSE
119900     IF STR-LAST-IDATE-CN < SLOW-MOVE-DATE-CN
