122700     ELSE
122800     IF SORT-CLASS NOT = SAVE-CLASS
122900         PERFORM 8000-CTL-BREAK-CLASS
123000         PERFORM 8020-HEADERS
123100     ELSE
123200     IF LINE-K > 55
123300         PERFORM 8020-HEADERS.
123400
123500     IF SORT-AVG-COST-X NOT NUMERIC
123600         MOVE "AVG COST NOT NUMERIC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
123700         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
