124700       GIVING HOLD-TOTAL-VAL-USE ROUNDED.
124800     MOVE HOLD-TOTAL-VAL-USE          TO   PRT-VAL-USE.
124900     DIVIDE SORT-USE-UNITS BY NUM-DAYS
125000       GIVING HOLD-AVG-UNITS.
125100     MOVE HOLD-AVG-UNITS           TO   PRT-AVG-USE-UNITS.
125200
125300 7025-AVERAGE-USE-VAL.
125400     DIVIDE HOLD-TOTAL-VAL-USE BY NUM-DAYS
125500       GIVING HOLD-AVG-DLY-USE-VAL.
125600     MOVE HOLD-AVG-DLY-USE-VAL     TO   PRT-AVG-VAL-USE.
125700
