153200     MOVE GROUP-VAL-SLOW-MOVE (SUB) TO  PRT-GRP-VAL-SLOW-MOVE.
153300
153400     WRITE PRT-REC FROM SUM2-DETAIL-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
153500     WRITE PRT-REC FROM SUM2-EMPTY-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
153600     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DASH-LINE-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
